OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh bombing inquiry hears
OL,4,Aevidence of movements of car that
OL,5,Acarried bomb
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Omagh Bombing Inquiry has heard
OL,8,Fmore pre-recorded video evidence from a
OL,9,Fsenior Irish police officer about the
OL,10,Fmovements of the car which carried the
OL,11,Fbomb to Omagh.
OL,13,FDet Supt Emmett Casserly of An Garda
OL,14,FSiochana was questioned by the inquiry
OL,15,Fteam about evidence gathered by the
OL,16,Fservice.
OL,18,FPaul Greaney KC took the garda through
OL,19,Fthe evidence held that related to the
OL,20,Ftheft of the car and its known
OL,21,Fmovements.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
