OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh bombing inquiry hears
OL,4,Aevidence of movements of car that
OL,5,Acarried bomb
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry heard that gardai evidence
OL,8,Fdid not show where the car was located
OL,9,Fafter it was stolen in the early hours
OL,10,Fof the 13 August until 15 August 1998
OL,11,Fwhen the bomb exploded.
